#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:536
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:749
msgid ""
"Given a few corpus files: A.jsonl, B.jsonl, and C.jsonl, your config will"
" look like the below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:70
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:538
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:751
msgid ""
"While we recommend .jsonl, you can also use the other formats (csv, "
"parquet, arrow, SQL, Webdataset) that are supported by "
"Dataset.load_dataset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:72
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:540
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:753
msgid ""
"In the case that the dataset is small and can be loaded entirely into "
"memory, another approach to running pre-training is to use the completion"
" format. This would mean that the entire dataset is pre-tokenized instead"
" of on-demand in streaming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:74
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:542
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:755
msgid ""
"One benefit of this is that the tokenization can be performed separately "
"on a CPU-only machine, and then transferred to a GPU machine for training"
" to save costs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:76
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:544
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:757
msgid ""
"For completion only, Axolotl would split texts if it exceeds the context "
"length into multiple smaller prompts. If you are interested in having "
"this for pretraining_dataset too, please let us know or help make a PR!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:78
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:546
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:759
msgid ""
"When using streaming for large datasets, Axolotl does not know in advance"
" how large the dataset is and does not know when to stop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:80
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:548
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:761
msgid ""
"Therefore, it is necessary to set max_steps: int in your config for pre-"
"training to run, so that Axolotl knows when to stop training."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:82
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:550
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:763
msgid ""
"One step is equal to sequence_len * micro_batch_size * "
"gradient_accumulation_steps * total_num_gpus tokens."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:84
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:552
#: ../../source/references_dataset-formats.md:765
msgid ""
"It is recommended to leave this off if downloading from Hugging Face hub "
"as it would download the entire dataset which can be very large."
msgstr ""

